@url=http://localhost:3000

GET {{url}}/rectangulos



###Crear rectangulo
POST {{url}}/rectangulos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "base": 10,
    "altura": 5
}



### Modificar rectangulo
PUT {{url}}/rectangulos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "base": 20,
    "altura": 10
}



###Obtener rectangulo por ID
GET {{url}}/rectangulos/1



###Eliminar rectangulo
DELETE {{url}}/rectangulos/1



###Error aproposito de base negativa
POST {{url}}/rectangulos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "base": -10,
    "altura": 5
}



###Error aproposito de falta la altura
POST {{url}}/rectangulos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "base": 10
}



###Error aproposito de base no numérica
POST {{url}}/rectangulos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "base": "hola",
    "altura": 5
}



### Error de ID inválido
GET {{url}}/rectangulos/abc